@subheading Metadata block

@table @code
@item pre_score, post_score
Combined optimisation score before and after.
@item per_channel_epa
EPA decomposition per channel (flatness, sharpness, roughness,
loudness balance, modal temporal masking, CDT level).
@item multichannel_epa
EPA over the matched channel set.
@item inter_channel_deviation
Per-band SPL delta heatmap.
@item bass_management_report
Routing graph, group crossovers, headroom simulation, advisories.
@item perceptual_metrics
FIR pre/post-ringing summary when FIR is generated.
@item optimizer
Algorithm, iteration counts.
@item version
Output schema version stamp.
@end table

